{
  "title": "Hearty Herbed Croatian Lamb Skewers",
  "description": "A garlicky and adventurous Croatian dish featuring lamb skewers with a hint of lemon and shio-cure, perfect for a macrobiotic-friendly dinner",
  "cuisine": "Croatian",
  "diet": [
    "macrobiotic",
